		(uuid "6f0ad29c-6653-5956-8855-6861fdc05703")
	)
	(text "Board is USB powered. Arty PMOD VCC (pins 6, 12) is isolated from +3V3\nby open jumper JP601 to avoid back-feeding either regulator.\nDo not close with USB connected."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 218.44 81.28 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "7a7acce2-8a31-5871-82e4-625f29df920f")
	)
	(text "Series terminations at the buffer outputs.\nY0 -> RT1010 SAI1_MCLK (GPIO_08)\nY1 -> RT1010 GPT2_CLK (GPIO_AD_03), async feedback\nY2 -> PMOD JC1 (MCLK, top row)\nY3 -> PMOD JC7 (MCLK, bottom row)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 109.22 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "ab4bc2a1-85f0-5c1c-aba1-17bf7aeeae5d")
	)
	(text "Pmod I2S2 pinout (host = FPGA):\n  1-4  D/A row: MCLK, LRCK, SCLK, SDIN   = FPGA -> RT1010 (SAI1 RX)\n  7-10 A/D row: MCLK, LRCK, SCLK, SDOUT = RT1010 -> FPGA (SAI1 TX)\nAll clocks are driven by this board: the FPGA must treat JC1-3 and JC7-9 as inputs.\nArty HS pairs 1-2 and 7-8 couple MCLK with LRCK (LRCK is a slow, sampled signal)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 218.44 238.76 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "bc553a04-f171-592c-a479-afdca2a5a167")
	)
